><span begin="02:41.539" end="02:41.861">daI</span><span begin="02:41.861" end="02:41.989">love</span><span begin="02:41.989" end="02:42.192">you</span><span begin="02:42.192" end="02:42.384"></span><span begin="02:42.384" end="02:42.751"></span><span begin="02:42.751" end="02:43.288">baby</span></text><text for="L59"><span begin="02:43.555" end="02:44.041">toki</span><span begin="02:44.041" end="02:44.412">do</span><span begin="02:44.412" end="02:44.845">ki</span><span begin="02:44.845" end="02:45.229">I'm</span><span begin="02:45.229" end="02:45.701">going</span><span begin="02:45.701" end="02:46.101"></span><span begin="02:46.101" end="02:46.611">crazy</span></text><text for="L60"><span begin="02:46.868" end="02:47.328">kori</span><span begin="02:47.328" end="02:47.733">go</span><span begin="02:47.733" end="02:48.218">rina</span><span begin="02:48.218" end="02:48.797">noniI</span><span begin="02:48.797" end="02:49.032"></span><span begin="02:49.032" end="02:49.364">want</span><span begin="02:49.364" end="02:49.884">you</span></text><text for="L61"><span begin="02:49.816" end="02:50.252">numa'tte</span><span begin="02:50.252" end="02:50.693">ruki</span><span begin="02:50.693" end="02:50.983">mino</span><span begin="02:50.983" end="02:51.164">a</span><span begin="02:51.164" end="02:51.450">ihi</span><span begin="02:51.450" end="02:51.679">to</span><span begin="02:51.679" end="02:51.836">ri</span><span begin="02:51.836" end="02:51.990">ji</span><span begin="02:51.990" end="02:52.334">me</span><span begin="02:52.334" end="02:53.846">sasete</span></text></transliteration></transliterations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="02:56.952"><div begin="00:13.537" end="02:53.846"><p begin="00:13.537" end="00:16.588" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:13.537" end="00:14.031">もし</span><span begin="00:14.031" end="00:14.380">も</span><span begin="00:14.380" end="00:14.839">し</span> <span begin="00:14.839" end="00:15.161">まだ</span> <span begin="00:15.161" end="00:15.289">I</span> <span begin="00:15.289" end="00:15.492">love</span> <span begin="00:15.492" end="00:15.684">you</span> <span begin="00:15.684" end="00:16.051">ba</span><span begin="00:16.051" end="00:16.588">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喂 我对你的爱意仍未改变 宝贝</span></p><p begin="00:16.874" end="00:19.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:16.874" end="00:17.360">とき</span><span begin="00:17.360" end="00:17.731">ど</span><span begin="00:17.731" end="00:18.164">き</span> <span begin="00:18.164" end="00:18.548">I'm</span> <span begin="00:18.548" end="00:19.020">going</span> <span begin="00:19.020" end="00:19.420">cra</span><span begin="00:19.420" end="00:19.930">zy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有时我会觉得自己就要疯掉</span></p><p begin="00:20.202" end="00:23.123" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:20.202" end="00:20.662">懲り</span><span begin="00:20.662" end="00:21.067">懲</span><span begin="00:21.067" end="00:21.552">り</span><span begin="00:21.552" end="00:22.131">なのに</span> <span begin="00:22.131" end="00:22.366">I</span> <span begin="00:22.366" end="00:22.698">want</span> <span begin="00:22.698" end="00:23.123">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明吃尽苦头可我依然渴望你</span></p><p begin="00:23.123" end="00:26.921" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:23.123" end="00:23.559">沼っ</span><span begin="00:23.559" end="00:24.000">てる</span>  <span begin="00:24.000" end="00:24.290">君</span><span begin="00:24.290" end="00:24.471">の</span><span begin="00:24.471" end="00:24.757">愛</span>  <span begin="00:24.757" end="00:24.986">独</span><span begin="00:24.986" end="00:25.143">り</span><span begin="00:25.143" end="00:25.297">占</span><span begin="00:25.297" end="00:25.641">め</span><span begin="00:25.641" end="00:26.921">させて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深陷于泥沼 就让我独占你的爱吧</span></p><p begin="00:26.921" end="00:29.972" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:26.921" end="00:27.415">もし</span><span begin="00:27.415" end="00:27.764">も</span><span begin="00:27.764" end="00:28.223">し</span> <span begin="00:28.223" end="00:28.545">まだ</span> <span begin="00:28.545" end="00:28.673">I</span> <span begin="00:28.673" end="00:28.876">love</span> <span begin="00:28.876" end="00:29.068">you</span> <span begin="00:29.068" end="00:29.435">ba</span><span begin="00:29.435" end="00:29.972">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喂 我对你的爱意仍未改变 宝贝</span></p><p begin="00:30.215" end="00:33.271" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:30.215" end="00:30.701">とき</span><span begin="00:30.701" end="00:31.072">ど</span><span begin="00:31.072" end="00:31.505">き</span> <span begin="00:31.505" end="00:31.889">I'm</span> <span begin="00:31.889" end="00:32.361">going</span> <span begin="00:32.361" end="00:32.761">cra</span><span begin="00:32.761" end="00:33.271">zy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有时我会觉得自己就要疯掉</span></p><p begin="00:33.530" end="00:36.554" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:33.530" end="00:33.990">懲り</span><span begin="00:33.990" end="00:34.395">懲</span><span begin="00:34.395" end="00:34.880">り</span><span begin="00:34.880" end="00:35.459">なのに</span> <span begin="00:35.459" end="00:35.694">I</span> <span begin="00:35.694" end="00:36.026">want</span> <span begin="00:36.026" end="00:36.554">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明吃尽苦头可我依然渴望你</span></p><p begin="00:36.494" end="00:40.312" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:36.494" end="00:36.930">沼っ</span><span begin="00:36.930" end="00:37.371">てる</span>  <span begin="00:37.371" end="00:37.661">君</span><span begin="00:37.661" end="00:37.842">の</span><span begin="00:37.842" end="00:38.128">愛</span>  <span begin="00:38.128" end="00:38.357">独</span><span begin="00:38.357" end="00:38.514">り</span><span begin="00:38.514" end="00:38.668">占</span><span begin="00:38.668" end="00:39.012">め</span><span begin="00:39.012" end="00:40.312">させて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深陷于泥沼 就让我独占你的爱吧</span></p><p begin="00:40.421" end="00:42.421" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:40.421" end="00:41.090">会える</span><span begin="00:41.090" end="00:41.679">わけも</span><span begin="00:41.679" end="00:41.957">ない</span><span begin="00:41.957" end="00:42.188">の</span><span begin="00:42.188" end="00:42.421">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明不可能与你再见了</span></p><p begin="00:42.477" end="00:43.749" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:42.477" end="00:42.839">また</span><span begin="00:42.839" end="00:43.180">会い</span><span begin="00:43.180" end="00:43.749">たい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍控制不住想见你</span></p><p begin="00:43.773" end="00:45.751" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:43.773" end="00:44.410">好きな</span><span begin="00:44.410" end="00:45.031">わけも</span><span begin="00:45.031" end="00:45.292">ない</span><span begin="00:45.292" end="00:45.751">のに</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明不可能继续爱你了</span></p><p begin="00:45.791" end="00:47.078" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:45.791" end="00:46.313">好き</span><span begin="00:46.313" end="00:46.504">でい</span><span begin="00:46.504" end="00:47.078">たい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我依然想要爱你</span></p><p begin="00:47.115" end="00:49.168" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:47.115" end="00:47.770">会える</span><span begin="00:47.770" end="00:48.152">だけ</span><span begin="00:48.152" end="00:48.410">じゃ</span><span begin="00:48.410" end="00:49.168">足りない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算可以见面依然难以满足</span></p><p begin="00:49.208" end="00:51.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:49.208" end="00:50.035">止まらない</span><span begin="00:50.035" end="00:50.466">君</span><span begin="00:50.466" end="00:50.886">への</span><span begin="00:50.886" end="00:51.291">想</span><span begin="00:51.291" end="00:51.400">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">根本抑制不住对你的思念</span></p><p begin="00:51.475" end="00:53.076" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:51.475" end="00:51.932">戻</span><span begin="00:51.932" end="00:52.105">り</span><span begin="00:52.105" end="00:52.299">たい</span><span begin="00:52.299" end="00:52.748">そば</span><span begin="00:52.748" end="00:53.076">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多想重回你身边</span></p><p begin="00:53.085" end="00:54.830" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:53.085" end="00:53.185">“What</span> <span begin="00:53.185" end="00:53.285">do</span> <span begin="00:53.285" end="00:53.385">you</span> <span begin="00:53.385" end="00:53.611">wanna</span> <span begin="00:53.611" end="00:53.982">do,</span> <span begin="00:53.982" end="00:54.390">my</span> <span begin="00:54.390" end="00:54.830">bae?”</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“你到底想怎么做 我的宝贝?” 事到如今才这么问</span></p><p begin="00:54.830" end="00:56.139" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="00:54.830" end="00:55.622">今更</span><span begin="00:55.622" end="00:56.139">もう</span></p><p begin="00:56.270" end="00:57.731" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="00:56.270" end="00:56.499">“I</span> <span begin="00:56.499" end="00:56.920">wanna</span> <span begin="00:56.920" end="00:57.320">do</span> <span begin="00:57.320" end="00:57.731">this!”</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“除此之外别无他求” 一切都太迟了啊</span></p><p begin="00:57.747" end="00:59.603" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="00:57.747" end="00:58.385">なんて</span><span begin="00:58.385" end="00:58.824">遅</span><span begin="00:58.824" end="00:58.997">い</span><span begin="00:58.997" end="00:59.603">ね</span></p><p begin="00:59.800" end="01:01.467" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="00:59.800" end="01:00.455">「終わる</span><span begin="01:00.455" end="01:01.055">ことは</span><span begin="01:01.055" end="01:01.467">ない。」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“永远不都不会结束”</span></p><p begin="01:01.467" end="01:03.178" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:01.467" end="01:01.885">そう</span><span begin="01:01.885" end="01:02.108">やっ</span><span begin="01:02.108" end="01:02.223">て</span><span begin="01:02.223" end="01:02.564">甘</span><span begin="01:02.564" end="01:02.719">え</span><span begin="01:02.719" end="01:03.178">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此撒娇耍赖 终究还是失去了你</span></p><p begin="01:03.178" end="01:04.813" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:03.178" end="01:03.768">失っ</span><span begin="01:03.768" end="01:03.929">て</span><span begin="01:03.929" end="01:04.396">しまっ</span><span begin="01:04.396" end="01:04.813">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终究还是失去了你 在孤单的夜晚悔恨不已</span></p><p begin="01:04.813" end="01:07.616" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:04.813" end="01:05.259">後</span><span begin="01:05.259" end="01:05.486">悔</span><span begin="01:05.486" end="01:06.088">してる</span> <span begin="01:06.088" end="01:06.947">lonely</span> <span begin="01:06.947" end="01:07.616">night…</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在孤单的夜晚悔恨不已</span></p><p begin="01:07.895" end="01:11.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:07.895" end="01:08.605">やるせ</span><span begin="01:08.605" end="01:09.005">ない</span> <span begin="01:09.005" end="01:09.381">この</span><span begin="01:09.381" end="01:09.806">想</span><span begin="01:09.806" end="01:10.243">い</span><span begin="01:10.243" end="01:11.100">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份感情难以排解</span></p><p begin="01:11.284" end="01:14.399" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:11.284" end="01:11.747">何</span><span begin="01:11.747" end="01:12.342">気ない</span> <span begin="01:12.342" end="01:12.798">あの</span><span begin="01:12.798" end="01:13.600">道</span><span begin="01:13.600" end="01:14.399">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕走上往常的那条路</span></p><p begin="01:14.597" end="01:17.477" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:14.597" end="01:15.204">意味が</span><span begin="01:15.204" end="01:15.572">ない</span> <span begin="01:15.572" end="01:15.901">他</span><span begin="01:15.901" end="01:16.109">の</span><span begin="01:16.109" end="01:16.892">人</span><span begin="01:16.892" end="01:17.477">じゃ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依旧毫无意义可言 除你之外</span></p><p begin="01:17.663" end="01:19.978" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:17.663" end="01:18.181">君</span><span begin="01:18.181" end="01:18.580">だけ</span><span begin="01:18.580" end="01:19.033">なん</span><span begin="01:19.033" end="01:19.438">だっ</span><span begin="01:19.438" end="01:19.978">て！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不要任何人</span></p><p begin="01:20.212" end="01:23.263" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:20.212" end="01:20.706">もし</span><span begin="01:20.706" end="01:21.055">も</span><span begin="01:21.055" end="01:21.514">し</span> <span begin="01:21.514" end="01:21.836">まだ</span> <span begin="01:21.836" end="01:21.964">I</span> <span begin="01:21.964" end="01:22.167">love</span> <span begin="01:22.167" end="01:22.359">you</span> <span begin="01:22.359" end="01:22.726">ba</span><span begin="01:22.726" end="01:23.263">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喂 我对你的爱意仍未改变 宝贝</span></p><p begin="01:23.531" end="01:26.587" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:23.531" end="01:24.017">とき</span><span begin="01:24.017" end="01:24.388">ど</span><span begin="01:24.388" end="01:24.821">き</span> <span begin="01:24.821" end="01:25.205">I'm</span> <span begin="01:25.205" end="01:25.677">going</span> <span begin="01:25.677" end="01:26.077">cra</span><span begin="01:26.077" end="01:26.587">zy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有时我会觉得自己就要疯掉</span></p><p begin="01:26.907" end="01:29.816" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="01:26.907" end="01:27.332">懲り</span><span begin="01:27.332" end="01:27.758">懲</span><span begin="01:27.758" end="01:28.195">り</span><span begin="01:28.195" end="01:28.806">なのに</span> <span begin="01:28.806" end="01:29.025">I</span> <span begin="01:29.025" end="01:29.364">want</span> <span begin="01:29.364" end="01:29.816">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明吃尽苦头可我依然渴望你</span></p><p begin="01:29.816" end="01:33.614" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="01:29.816" end="01:30.287">沼っ</span><span begin="01:30.287" end="01:30.693">てる</span>  <span begin="01:30.693" end="01:30.983">君</span><span begin="01:30.983" end="01:31.164">の</span><span begin="01:31.164" end="01:31.450">愛</span>  <span begin="01:31.450" end="01:31.679">独</span><span begin="01:31.679" end="01:31.836">り</span><span begin="01:31.836" end="01:31.990">占</span><span begin="01:31.990" end="01:32.306">め</span><span begin="01:32.306" end="01:33.614">させて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深陷于泥沼 就让我独占你的爱吧</span></p><p begin="01:33.578" end="01:36.629" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="01:33.578" end="01:34.050">もし</span><span begin="01:34.050" end="01:34.362">も</span><span begin="01:34.362" end="01:34.843">し</span> <span begin="01:34.843" end="01:35.169">まだ</span> <span begin="01:35.169" end="01:35.286">I</span> <span begin="01:35.286" end="01:35.512">love</span> <span begin="01:35.512" end="01:35.686">you</span> <span begin="01:35.686" end="01:36.073">ba</span><span begin="01:36.073" end="01:36.629">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喂 我对你的爱意仍未改变 宝贝</span></p><p begin="01:36.882" end="01:39.938" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="01:36.882" end="01:37.368">とき</span><span begin="01:37.368" end="01:37.739">ど</span><span begin="01:37.739" end="01:38.172">き</span> <span begin="01:38.172" end="01:38.556">I'm</span> <span begin="01:38.556" end="01:39.028">going</span> <span begin="01:39.028" end="01:39.428">cra</span><span begin="01:39.428" end="01:39.938">zy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有时我会觉得自己就要疯掉</span></p><p begin="01:40.195" end="01:43.195" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="01:40.195" end="01:40.655">懲り</span><span begin="01:40.655" end="01:41.060">懲</span><span begin="01:41.060" end="01:41.545">り</span><span begin="01:41.545" end="01:42.124">なのに</span> <span begin="01:42.124" end="01:42.359">I</span> <span begin="01:42.359" end="01:42.691">want</span> <span begin="01:42.691" end="01:43.195">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明吃尽苦头可我依然渴望你</span></p><p begin="01:43.136" end="01:46.934" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="01:43.136" end="01:43.572">沼っ</span><span begin="01:43.572" end="01:44.013">てる</span>  <span begin="01:44.013" end="01:44.303">君</span><span begin="01:44.303" end="01:44.484">の</span><span begin="01:44.484" end="01:44.770">愛</span>  <span begin="01:44.770" end="01:44.999">独</span><span begin="01:44.999" end="01:45.156">り</span><span begin="01:45.156" end="01:45.310">占</span><span begin="01:45.310" end="01:45.625">め</span><span begin="01:45.625" end="01:46.934">させて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深陷于泥沼 就让我独占你的爱吧</span></p><p begin="01:45.827" end="01:47.387" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="01:45.827" end="01:46.520">やりたい</span><span begin="01:46.520" end="01:46.928">よう</span><span begin="01:46.928" end="01:47.387">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是在电话中争吵不断 我已经受够了</span></p><p begin="01:47.489" end="01:49.073" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="01:47.489" end="01:47.745">やっ</span><span begin="01:47.745" end="01:48.142">てる</span><span begin="01:48.142" end="01:49.073">のに</span></p><p begin="01:49.139" end="01:50.696" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="01:49.139" end="01:49.799">キリが</span><span begin="01:49.799" end="01:50.239">なく</span><span begin="01:50.239" end="01:50.696">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明我们是如此深爱对方</span></p><p begin="01:50.861" end="01:52.307" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="01:50.861" end="01:51.744">モヤモヤ</span><span begin="01:51.744" end="01:52.307">してる</span></p><p begin="01:52.307" end="01:54.836" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="01:52.307" end="01:52.736">誰</span><span begin="01:52.736" end="01:52.979">も</span><span begin="01:52.979" end="01:53.608">変わり</span><span begin="01:53.608" end="01:53.974">は</span><span begin="01:53.974" end="01:54.389">い</span><span begin="01:54.389" end="01:54.836">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是无话可说</span></p><p begin="01:54.836" end="01:56.503" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="01:54.836" end="01:55.245">感</span><span begin="01:55.245" end="01:55.670">じ</span><span begin="01:55.670" end="01:56.089">て</span><span begin="01:56.089" end="01:56.503">たい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那就无需回复</span></p><p begin="01:56.503" end="01:58.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="01:56.503" end="01:56.959">君</span><span begin="01:56.959" end="01:57.361">の</span><span begin="01:57.361" end="01:58.140">愛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你在俱乐部里</span></p><p begin="01:58.140" end="01:59.808" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43"><span begin="01:58.140" end="01:58.556">まだ</span><span begin="01:58.556" end="01:59.808">そばに</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开心地分享着自己的故事</span></p><p begin="01:59.808" end="02:02.826" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44"><span begin="01:59.808" end="02:00.284">教</span><span begin="02:00.284" end="02:01.108">えて</span> <span begin="02:01.108" end="02:01.476">なん</span><span begin="02:01.476" end="02:01.725">で</span><span begin="02:01.725" end="02:02.346">こんなに</span><span begin="02:02.346" end="02:02.826">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的手比我还小</span></p><p begin="02:02.915" end="02:06.251" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45"><span begin="02:02.915" end="02:03.601">虜</span><span begin="02:03.601" end="02:03.966">に</span><span begin="02:03.966" end="02:04.387">さ</span><span begin="02:04.387" end="02:05.059">せるの</span> <span begin="02:05.059" end="02:05.709">私</span><span begin="02:05.709" end="02:06.251">を？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算再怎么后悔都太迟了</span></p><p begin="02:06.425" end="02:08.182" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46"><span begin="02:06.425" end="02:07.115">超える</span><span begin="02:07.115" end="02:07.579">人</span><span begin="02:07.579" end="02:08.182">いない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是在意</span></p><p begin="02:08.182" end="02:09.829" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47"><span begin="02:08.182" end="02:08.621">興</span><span begin="02:08.621" end="02:08.809">味</span><span begin="02:08.809" end="02:09.406">すらも</span><span begin="02:09.406" end="02:09.829">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">到底是谁的错</span></p><p begin="02:09.829" end="02:11.483" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48"><span begin="02:09.829" end="02:10.453">むしろ</span><span begin="02:10.453" end="02:11.085">見つけ</span><span begin="02:11.085" end="02:11.483">たい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“希望你不要离开我”</span></p><p begin="02:11.483" end="02:14.307" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49"><span begin="02:11.483" end="02:12.125">なのに</span><span begin="02:12.125" end="02:12.864">浮かぶの</span> <span begin="02:12.864" end="02:13.547">only</span> <span begin="02:13.547" end="02:14.307">you…</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若你能说句软话那就一切翻篇</span></p><p begin="02:14.544" end="02:17.784" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50"><span begin="02:14.544" end="02:15.027">隠</span><span begin="02:15.027" end="02:15.646">せない</span> <span begin="02:15.646" end="02:16.061">この</span><span begin="02:16.061" end="02:16.475">想</span><span begin="02:16.475" end="02:16.947">い</span><span begin="02:16.947" end="02:17.784">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">电话难以传达真实的心意</span></p><p begin="02:17.955" end="02:21.088" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51"><span begin="02:17.955" end="02:18.393">思</span><span begin="02:18.393" end="02:18.609">い</span><span begin="02:18.609" end="02:19.060">出す</span> <span begin="02:19.060" end="02:19.479">あの</span><span begin="02:19.479" end="02:20.268">道</span><span begin="02:20.268" end="02:21.088">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便你依然不曾回我消息</span></p><p begin="02:21.268" end="02:24.172" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52"><span begin="02:21.268" end="02:21.958">意味が</span><span begin="02:21.958" end="02:22.230">ない</span> <span begin="02:22.230" end="02:22.595">他</span><span begin="02:22.595" end="02:22.779">の</span><span begin="02:22.779" end="02:23.552">人</span><span begin="02:23.552" end="02:24.172">じゃ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">给你发送消息</span></p><p begin="02:24.340" end="02:26.636" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53"><span begin="02:24.340" end="02:24.821">君</span><span begin="02:24.821" end="02:25.256">だけ</span><span begin="02:25.256" end="02:25.686">なん</span><span begin="02:25.686" end="02:26.094">だっ</span><span begin="02:26.094" end="02:26.636">て！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望你可以倾听我的心声</span></p><p begin="02:26.872" end="02:29.923" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54"><span begin="02:26.872" end="02:27.366">もし</span><span begin="02:27.366" end="02:27.715">も</span><span begin="02:27.715" end="02:28.174">し</span> <span begin="02:28.174" end="02:28.496">まだ</span> <span begin="02:28.496" end="02:28.624">I</span> <span begin="02:28.624" end="02:28.827">love</span> <span begin="02:28.827" end="02:29.019">you</span> <span begin="02:29.019" end="02:29.386">ba</span><span begin="02:29.386" end="02:29.923">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喂 我对你的爱意仍未改变 宝贝</span></p><p begin="02:30.198" end="02:33.254" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55"><span begin="02:30.198" end="02:30.684">とき</span><span begin="02:30.684" end="02:31.055">ど</span><span begin="02:31.055" end="02:31.488">き</span> <span begin="02:31.488" end="02:31.872">I'm</span> <span begin="02:31.872" end="02:32.344">going</span> <span begin="02:32.344" end="02:32.744">cra</span><span begin="02:32.744" end="02:33.254">zy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有时我会觉得自己就要疯掉</span></p><p begin="02:33.572" end="02:36.474" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56"><span begin="02:33.572" end="02:34.046">懲り</span><span begin="02:34.046" end="02:34.437">懲</span><span begin="02:34.437" end="02:34.875">り</span><span begin="02:34.875" end="02:35.480">なのに</span> <span begin="02:35.480" end="02:35.699">I</span> <span begin="02:35.699" end="02:36.051">want</span> <span begin="02:36.051" end="02:36.474">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明吃尽苦头可我依然渴望你</span></p><p begin="02:36.475" end="02:40.273" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57"><span begin="02:36.475" end="02:36.947">沼っ</span><span begin="02:36.947" end="02:37.352">てる</span>  <span begin="02:37.352" end="02:37.642">君</span><span begin="02:37.642" end="02:37.808">の</span><span begin="02:37.808" end="02:38.072">愛</span>  <span begin="02:38.072" end="02:38.350">独</span><span begin="02:38.350" end="02:38.495">り</span><span begin="02:38.495" end="02:38.628">占</span><span begin="02:38.628" end="02:38.962">め</span><span begin="02:38.962" end="02:40.273">させて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深陷于泥沼 就让我独占你的爱吧</span></p><p begin="02:40.237" end="02:43.288" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58"><span begin="02:40.237" end="02:40.731">もし</span><span begin="02:40.731" end="02:41.080">も</span><span begin="02:41.080" end="02:41.539">し</span> <span begin="02:41.539" end="02:41.861">まだ</span> <span begin="02:41.861" end="02:41.989">I</span> <span begin="02:41.989" end="02:42.192">love</span> <span begin="02:42.192" end="02:42.384">you</span> <span begin="02:42.384" end="02:42.751">ba</span><span begin="02:42.751" end="02:43.288">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喂 我对你的爱意仍未改变 宝贝</span></p><p begin="02:43.555" end="02:46.611" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59"><span begin="02:43.555" end="02:44.041">とき</span><span begin="02:44.041" end="02:44.412">ど</span><span begin="02:44.412" end="02:44.845">き</span> <span begin="02:44.845" end="02:45.229">I'm</span> <span begin="02:45.229" end="02:45.701">going</span> <span begin="02:45.701" end="02:46.101">cra</span><span begin="02:46.101" end="02:46.611">zy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有时我会觉得自己就要疯掉</span></p><p begin="02:46.868" end="02:49.884" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60"><span begin="02:46.868" end="02:47.328">懲り</span><span begin="02:47.328" end="02:47.733">懲</span><span begin="02:47.733" end="02:48.218">り</span><span begin="02:48.218" end="02:48.797">なのに</span> <span begin="02:48.797" end="02:49.032">I</span> <span begin="02:49.032" end="02:49.364">want</span> <span begin="02:49.364" end="02:49.884">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明吃尽苦头可我依然渴望你</span></p><p begin="02:49.816" end="02:53.846" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61"><span begin="02:49.816" end="02:50.252">沼っ</span><span begin="02:50.252" end="02:50.693">てる</span>  <span begin="02:50.693" end="02:50.983">君</span><span begin="02:50.983" end="02:51.164">の</span><span begin="02:51.164" end="02:51.450">愛</span>  <span begin="02:51.450" end="02:51.679">独</span><span begin="02:51.679" end="02:51.836">り</span><span begin="02:51.836" end="02:51.990">占</span><span begin="02:51.990" end="02:52.334">め</span><span begin="02:52.334" end="02:53.846">させて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深陷于泥沼 就让我独占你的爱吧</span></p></div></body></tt>